From cf64aad0d8d08a5544ae04f7005841ab667a8598 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: thequipster <zhengziqian0501@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 19:46:03 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(ui): fold trailing separator dot into timeNoWrap span so
 it never hangs at line end (RR38)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Collection-status card sub-copy: '最近更新成功 · <span nowrap>time 北京时间</span>' had its
only break opportunity right after the dot, leaving a hanging '·' at end of line one in
both themes (residual of RR35 time-segment nowrap protection). The dot now sits inside
the nowrap span and wraps together with the time segment ('· 10/11 19:44 北京时间').

- new structural lock test ui.hanging-dot.test.ts (3 asserts: dot inside span, no
  regression to hanging structure, timeNoWrap stays nowrap)
- release dual-theme expanded shots 920x1380 (PMv2 DPI192) + independent visual
  sub-agent re-audit: 6/6 PASS (no hanging dot, time segment intact, both themes)
- gates: tsc OK / src/ui 112 (109+3) / full 269 (baseline 266, 0 failed) / mutation
  red-verified (dot moved back outside span -> 2 lock-test asserts red -> restore green)
- Rust n/a (src-tauri untouched) (S1011-1940)
---
